ath></svg> Govt of India verified</span><span class="chip border-saffron/25 bg-saffron-soft text-saffron-deep"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-3 w-3"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg> ₹0 for students</span></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-1"><img src="/images/aicte-logo.webp" alt="AICTE" class="h-11 w-auto object-contain"/><img src="/images/moe-emblem.webp" alt="Ministry of Education" class="h-11 w-auto object-contain"/></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-7 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-5 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="space-y-3"><h4 class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-inkFaint">Explore</h4><ul class="space-y-2"><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12.5px] font-bold text-inkSoft transition-colors hover:text-saffron-deep" href="/internships"><span class="relative">All internships<span class="absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 h-[1.5px] w-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-saffron to-rose2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full"></span></span></a></li><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12.5px] font-bold text-inkSoft transition-colors hover:text-saffron-deep" href="/internships?mode=Remote"><span class="relative">Remote &amp; hybrid<span class="absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 h-[1.5px] w-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-saffron to-rose2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full"></span></span></a></li><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1